<title>BRAZIL: Brokerages representing Brazil CVRD bidders named.</title>
<headline>Brokerages representing Brazil CVRD bidders named.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonte Cindam and Bozano, Simonsen said they will be the representing brokerages for the two consortia bidding in the privatization auction of Brazilian state mining group CVRD.</p>
<p>Fonte Cindam said it will be representing the Valepar consortium led by Brazilian steelmaker CSN at the April 29 auction of a 40-45 percent voting stake in CVRD.</p>
<p>Bozano Simonsen said it will be the brokerage for the Valecom consortium led by Brazilian metal, cement and pulp group Votorantim and South Africa's Anglo American Corp.</p>
<p>The strategic stake in CVRD is due to be auctioned on the Rio de Janeiro stock exchange at 1000 local time/1300 GMT Tuesday starting at a base price of three billion reais ($2.83 billion).</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
